      "x": 152,
      "y": 196,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 40,
      "strokeColor": "#55534d",
      "text": "A monitoring loop that catches a model going stale — it tracks a champion,\nmeasures drift, and retrains a challenger, promoting it only on unseen data.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
